"""Interactive Multi-Angle Face Enrollment Capture Tool.

Guides the operator to capture real webcam photos across all target angles for any employee:
1. Frontal (front)
2. 15° Left (15_left)
3. 30° Left (30_left)
4. 45° Left (45_left)
5. 15° Right (15_right)
6. 30° Right (30_right)
7. 45° Right (45_right)
8. Slightly Up (slightly_up)
9. Slightly Down (slightly_down)

Features:
1. Dynamic Employee ID and Name support (--employee EMP002 --name "Employee 2").
2. Saves strictly to data/enrollment/<employeeId>/ with continuous numbering.
3. Graceful handling of Ctrl+C (KeyboardInterrupt), Q, ESC, and camera read failure without secondary crashes.
4. Preserves all captured images upon interruption and compiles multi-view reference only if images exist.
5. Quality-gated capture with real-time HUD telemetry.
"""

